Third-party programs
--------------------

Public releases do not bundle ffmpeg. Audio transcoding uses an ffmpeg
binary already installed on the system PATH. ffmpeg is a separate project.
Builds of ffmpeg are often licensed under the GNU GPL or GNU LGPL, depending
on the compile options. Installing ffmpeg is optional and does not change
the MIT license of this source tree.
